O image to the folders below:<br>dat10.dat, dat11.dat and dat12.dat<br><br>=
<br>Acronis True Image 2024<br>Unpack the ISO image into a folder on the US=
B flash drive<br>Linux/Acronis2024<br><br>Acronis True Image 2021<br>Unpack=
