><br>Acronis True Image 2020<br>Unpack the ISO image into a folder on the U=
SB flash drive<br>Linux/Acronis2020<br><br>Acronis True Image 2019<br>Unpac=
k the ISO image into a folder on the USB flash drive<br>Linux/Acronis2019<b=
r><br>Acronis True Image 2018<br>Unpack the ISO image into a folder on the =
USB flash drive<br>Linux/Acronis2018<br><br>Acronis Disk Director 12<br>Unp=
ack the ISO image into a folder on the USB flash drive<br>Linux/ADD12<br><b=
