<div id=3D"sp1df4406f406af5ddd1" class=3D"text_spoiler" style=3D"display: n=
one;">
<div class=3D"contenteditable">You can add your own commands in cmd or bat =
files that will be executed when WinPE boots.<br>This could be, for example=
, connecting a network drive, or other available commands.<br>To do this, p=
lace cmd or bat files in the SSTR\bat folder, in the appropriate subfolder.
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><b>Examples:</b></p>
<p>I want Acronis True Image to start automatically after WinPE boot.</p>
<div class=3D"code-toolbar"><pre class=3D"language-markup" tabindex=3D"0"><=
code class=3D"language-markup">@echo off
timeout /t 10
cd /d "%~dp0..\..\"
start "" "MInst\Portable\x64\ATIH_x64.exe"
exit</code></pre><div class=3D"toolbar"><div class=3D"toolbar-item"><button=
 class=3D"copy-to-clipboard-button" type=3D"button" data-copy-state=3D"copy=
"><span><svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width=3D"1em" height=3D"1=
em" viewBox=3D"0 0 15 15"><path fill=3D"none" stroke=3D"currentcolor" d=3D"=
M11 1.5h2.5v12a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-10a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-12H4m1 7l2 2l3.5-4m-6-6h6v2=
a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z" stroke-width=3D"1"></path></svg> =D0=A1=
=D0=BA=D0=BE=D0=BF=D0=B8=D1=80=D0=BE=D0=B2=D0=B0=D1=82=D1=8C</span></button=
></div></div></div>
<p>or</p>
<div class=3D"code-toolbar"><pre class=3D"language-markup" tabindex=3D"0"><=
code class=3D"language-markup">@echo off
setlocal enabledelayedexpansion
timeout /t 10
set DiskLetter=3D%~d0
start "" "%DiskLetter%\SSTR\MInst\Portable\x64\ATIH_x64.exe"
exit</code></pre><div class=3D"toolbar"><div class=3D"toolbar-item"><button=
 class=3D"copy-to-clipboard-button" type=3D"button" data-copy-state=3D"copy=
"><span><svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width=3D"1em" height=3D"1=
