M11 1.5h2.5v12a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-10a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-12H4m1 7l2 2l3.5-4m-6-6h6v2=
a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z" stroke-width=3D"1"></path></svg> =D0=A1=
=D0=BA=D0=BE=D0=BF=D0=B8=D1=80=D0=BE=D0=B2=D0=B0=D1=82=D1=8C</span></button=
></div></div></div>
<p>I want to automatically mount a network drive after WinPE boots.</p>
<div class=3D"code-toolbar"><pre class=3D"language-markup" tabindex=3D"0"><=
code class=3D"language-markup">@echo off
timeout /t 10
ping strelec-pc
net use Z: \\STRELEC-PC\H /USER:SEREGA serega
